{
  "name": "mirrai",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "description": "不在身边的时候，TA 还在这里 —— 上传聊天记录，AI 重建 TA 的数字分身。Open-source AI companion with persona distillation, emotional state machine, and a graduation mechanism.",
